1. Cloud-provider architecture icons — @nodus-dev/icons-cloud
================================================================================

The package `@nodus-dev/icons-cloud` incorporates a curated subset of official
cloud-provider service icons, and compact "vector pack" data derived from them,
combined from the following official toolkits:

  - AWS Architecture Icons     — Amazon Web Services, Inc.
                                 https://aws.amazon.com/architecture/icons/
  - Azure Architecture Icons   — Microsoft Corporation.
                                 https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/icons/
  - Google Cloud icons         — Google LLC.
                                 https://cloud.google.com/icons

This artwork is the property of its respective providers and is used under each
provider's architecture-icon terms. It is EXCLUDED from the MIT grant in the
root LICENSE, and this repository grants you no rights to these providers'
trademarks or artwork. Before redistributing this material or building on the
curated subset, you must review and accept each provider's current icon usage
terms yourself.

The authoritative attribution, per-provider terms, and provenance for this
content live with the package:

  - packages/icons-cloud/LICENSE
  - packages/icons-cloud/NOTICE
  - packages/icons-cloud/LICENSES/{aws,azure,gcp}.md
  - packages/icons-cloud/provenance.json


